---
description: SortLens project rules (always on)
alwaysApply: true
---
Read and follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root before any change. Short version:
- Never delete, move, rename or modify user photos, zips or JSON. Read-only scanning.
- Any move/delete only through `backend/app/core/safety.py` with an approval id and undo log.
- Offline, CPU-only, resumable batches. Real data only; missing stays missing.
- Do only the task in `docs/tasks/`; run `scripts/check.sh` until it passes; work on `dev`, never push to `main`.
